# Copy to <config>/privacy-patterns and replace these comments with your own
# patterns. <config> is SYSTEM_TOOLS_CONFIG, default ~/.config/system.
# One extended regular expression per line, as `grep -E -f` reads them.
# Blank lines and lines starting with `#` are ignored.
#
# Examples of the shape, not values to keep:
#   your-hostname
#   you@your-domain\.example
#   /home/your-login/
#   [0-9]{12}
